agent-run delegation guide

Choose provider, model and profile; the broker selects the account.
Provider order reflects capacity; guidance comes from configuration.
Read this guide before each delegation; choose the first compatible available provider and a sufficient model/effort.
Brief one bounded task with role, paths, permissions and checks. Respect a request to work personally.
Use start for new work, resume for continuation, and keep the same agent_id across resumes. Follow each tool's delivery contract; verify the answer before accepting it.

